# Model Registry runtime state for native local dev (STORAGE_PATH in
# local.env points here) — contains provider API keys, must never be
# committed. See seed/models.json for a safe starting template.
/models.json

# Helm chart dependency archives (generated by `helm dependency update`)
**/*.tgz
**/charts/*/charts/

